From 03a1ab1776b6866b43b8dbf07d1af43ac07434f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Illescas Romero <illescas.daniel@protonmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 13:44:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 50/65] Flashlight: rend2 eye-origin spot cones
 (AddSpotLightToScene).

Replace the point-dlight chain (and wall-impact blob) with dual spot
lights from the view origin; GLSL applies cone attenuation under
r_dlightMode 1. REF_API 9 + CG_R_ADDSPOTLIGHTTOSCENE.
